# Deny everything by default, then allowlist exactly what containers/Dockerfile
# COPYs. Local-only directories (data/, .pixi/, .venv/, notebooks/, deploy/) must
# never be sent to the Docker daemon as build context; the deny-all first line
# already covers every one of them.
#
# .git is deliberately *not* allowlisted: the version reaches hatch-vcs through
# the VERSION build arg instead.
*

!pyproject.toml
!pixi.lock
!LICENSE
!README.md
!.gitignore
!src/
!scripts/
!config/
